  },
  {
    "id": 2023011040190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "『頑張る』の形とか意味って、\r\n人によって全然違うんだね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301104/2023011040190"
  },
  {
    "select": "だから面白いのかもな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "確かにそうだな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "少し難しいよな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『頑張る』の物差しも容量も、人によって全然違う\r\nだからこそ、共感できた時に嬉しく感じるのかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023011040200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん～……\r\nちょっとだけ、わかる気がするかも",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301104/2023011040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その違いを面白いと思えるかどうか、なのかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023011040210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nなんか難しそ～～～",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202301104/2023011040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はは、そうだな。自分で言っといてなんだが、\r\n俺にとっても、難しいことなのかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
